+Technicians enter an equipment serial number and need its calibration date, due date, and equipment description. A signed snapshot contains newline-delimited JSON records, a schema version, a snapshot date, and a signature manifest. Kiosks operate offline with 4 GB of RAM and serve lookups across approximately 90,000 records from snapshots up to 150 MB, targeting lookup completion within 250 ms.
 
